<view wx:if="{{view}}" class="sheet-backdrop"><view class="sheet"><view class="sheet-heading"><text>{{view.title}}</text><button class="secondary" bindtap="close" disabled="{{busy}}">返回会话</button></view><scroll-view scroll-y class="review-content"><text selectable class="review-detail">{{view.summary}}</text><text class="draft-term">{{view.budget}}</text><text class="draft-term">截止 {{view.deadline}}</text><text wx:for="{{view.questions}}" wx:key="*this" class="notice">{{item}}</text><view wx:if="{{view.suggestions.length}}" class="draft-suggestions"><text class="muted">服务端建议，尚未授权</text><text wx:for="{{view.suggestions}}" wx:key="*this" class="muted">{{item}}</text></view><text class="muted review-note">本次仅准备待审原订单。关联企业/产品资料和附件不授予公开或外发许可；批准与派发仍需分别确认。</text><checkbox-group wx:if="{{view.ready}}" bindchange="consent" class="draft-consents"><label><checkbox value="terms" checked="{{termsConfirmed}}" disabled="{{busy || uncertain}}"/>我确认本次额度上限和截止时间</label><label><checkbox value="public" checked="{{publicConfirmed}}" disabled="{{busy || uncertain}}"/>我确认以上本次文字范围可公开</label></checkbox-group><text wx:if="{{serverError || error}}" class="notice" role="alert">{{serverError || error}}</text></scroll-view><view class="draft-review-actions"><button class="secondary" bindtap="edit" disabled="{{busy || uncertain}}">在会话里编辑</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="reject" disabled="{{busy || uncertain}}">拒绝草案</button><button wx:if="{{view.ready}}" class="primary" bindtap="prepare" disabled="{{busy || uncertain || !termsConfirmed || !publicConfirmed}}">准备待审原单</button></view></view></view>
